  <acceptance-criteria>
    <criterion testable="true">Tests fail on origin/master: PUT canvas, JIT sync and each per-node route on a protected playbook refuse (409, or JIT runs on stored nodes) with zero Dataverse writes; an unreadable playbook returns 503 and writes nothing.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Must-not-fire: a user-authored playbook (all nodes marked, flag false, type != 2) saves, syncs and accepts per-node edits; a per-node create on it does not make it protected.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Build, the Ai filter, full ArchTests pass; publish-size delta reported; the caller search is recorded in the task notes.</criterion>
  </acceptance-criteria>
  <escalation>
    <trigger>Deploy tooling or the Designer relies on the per-node routes for system playbooks, or the guard needs a schema change: STOP and report.</trigger>
  </escalation>
