  <completion>Done 2026-11-27: PR #3278 squash-merged to master (ab86cb4f58; Closes #1698 and #1498; cherry-picks #1497) after an independent Opus adversarial review; uac-r2 approved its contract-test change. System playbooks are read-only on the canvas and the node routes. Superseded PR #1497 to be closed on the owner's go. On dev with the uac-r2 dev BFF deploy of 5cd40984b0 (2026-11-27, master 765a199922).</completion>
